[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15242.95, "timestamp": "04:14:02", "text": "英语？他们根本听不懂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15247.03, "timestamp": "04:14:07", "text": "以及我使用的翻译软件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15249.189, "timestamp": "04:14:09", "text": "这些翻译软件甚至都不具备这种功能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15250.51, "timestamp": "04:14:10", "text": "理解"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15255.03, "timestamp": "04:14:15", "text": "我，我就想，不管屏幕上显示的是什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15257.99, "timestamp": "04:14:17", "text": "屏幕上会显示实时字幕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15264.429, "timestamp": "04:14:24", "text": "错误的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15268.55, "timestamp": "04:14:28", "text": "是的，我想我知道该怎么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15271.03, "timestamp": "04:14:31", "text": "当我们不玩游戏的时候，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15286.11, "timestamp": "04:14:46", "text": "做？无线连接是可以实现的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15288.03, "timestamp": "04:14:48", "text": "每周。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15291.51, "timestamp": "04:14:51", "text": "所以五月份我会去……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15294.429, "timestamp": "04:14:54", "text": "休假3天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15297.389, "timestamp": "04:14:57", "text": "出色地。"}]